sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: EVConnectedPostSession
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a

    opt State is NOT StopAuthorized
        Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State StopAuthorized
    end

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (triggerReason = ChargingStateChanged, transactionInfo.chargingState = EVConnected, eventType = Updated)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse

    Note over CS,CSMS: Tool validations: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Post condition: State is EVConnectedPostSession
